# B20: Zero-Boilerplate Binary Wire Codec (`spin_binary_codec`)

This Stage 3 (`Jenny-Spin v0.4`) benchmark demonstrates `@apply(codec::binary)` for a telemetry wire packet header (`TelemetryPacket`):
1. **`@apply(codec::binary)`**: Automatically synthesizes `TelemetryPacket.new(seq_id, payload_len)`, `wire_size(self)`, `compute_checksum(self)`, `encode_digest(self)`, and `decode_header(raw_magic, raw_version, seq_id, payload_len, raw_checksum)` into `.spun/spin_binary_codec.spun.jn`.
2. **`verify_packet_roundtrip(seq_id: i64, payload_len: i64)`**: Allocates `val pkt = TelemetryPacket.new(seq_id, payload_len)`, decodes `val decoded = TelemetryPacket.decode_header(pkt.magic, pkt.version, pkt.seq_id, pkt.payload_len, pkt.checksum)?`, computes `val digest = decoded.encode_digest()?`, and returns `digest + decoded.wire_size()`.

```jenny
module spin_binary_codec

pub enum CodecError {
    BufferUnderflow,
    InvalidMagic,
    ChecksumMismatch,
}

@apply(codec::binary)
pub struct TelemetryPacket {
    pub magic: i64 = 43981,
    pub version: i64 = 1,
    pub seq_id: i64 = 0,
    pub payload_len: i64 = 0,
    pub checksum: i64 = 0,
    invariant self.version >= 1
    invariant self.payload_len >= 0 && self.payload_len <= 4096
}

pub fn verify_packet_roundtrip(seq_id: i64, payload_len: i64) -> i64 ! CodecError
    requires seq_id >= 0 && payload_len >= 0 && payload_len <= 4096 else CodecError.BufferUnderflow
    ensures result == seq_id * 10000 + payload_len + 40

@example("EX-B20-01: synthesize binary codec and verify roundtrip digest") {
    val digest = verify_packet_roundtrip(7, 256)?
    assert(digest == 70296)

    val pkt = TelemetryPacket.new(12, 512)
    assert(pkt.wire_size() == 40)
    val decoded = TelemetryPacket.decode_header(43981, 1, 12, 512, pkt.checksum)?
    assert(decoded.encode_digest()? == 120512)
}

@example("EX-B20-02: reject invalid magic, corrupted checksum, and out-of-range payload") {
    val pkt = TelemetryPacket.new(3, 128)
    val bad_magic = TelemetryPacket.decode_header(999, 1, 3, 128, pkt.checksum)
    assert(bad_magic is CodecError.InvalidMagic)

    val bad_csum = TelemetryPacket.decode_header(43981, 1, 3, 128, pkt.checksum + 1)
    assert(bad_csum is CodecError.ChecksumMismatch)

    val underflow = verify_packet_roundtrip(3, 8192)
    assert(underflow is CodecError.BufferUnderflow)
}
```
